{
  "id": "2CH.13",
  "number": "13",
  "bookId": "2CH",
  "reference": "2 Chronicles 13",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the eighteenth year of the reign of King Jeroboam of Israel, Abijah became king of Judah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he ruled for three years in Jerusalem. His mother was Micaiah daughter of Uriel, from the city of Gibeah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "War broke out between Abijah and Jeroboam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abijah raised an army of 400,000 soldiers, and Jeroboam opposed him with an army of 800,000.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The armies met in the hill country of Ephraim. King Abijah went up Mount Zemaraim and called out to Jeroboam and the Israelites: “Listen to me!” he said. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Don't you know that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, made an unbreakable covenant with David, giving him and his descendants kingship over Israel for ever? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeroboam son of Nebat rebelled against Solomon, his king. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Later he gathered together a group of worthless scoundrels, and they forced their will on Rehoboam son of Solomon, who was too young and inexperienced to resist them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now you propose to fight against the royal authority that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " gave to David's descendants. You have a huge army and have with you the gold bull calves that Jeroboam made to be your gods. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You drove out the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s priests, the descendants of Aaron, and you drove out the Levites. In their place you appointed priests in the same way that other nations do. Anybody who comes along with a bull or seven sheep can get himself consecrated as a priest of those so-called gods of yours.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“But we still serve the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God and have not abandoned him. Priests descended from Aaron perform their duties, and Levites assist them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Every morning and every evening they offer him incense and animal sacrifices burnt whole. They present the offerings of bread on a table that is ritually clean, and every evening they light the lamps on the gold lampstand. We do what the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has commanded, but you have abandoned him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God himself is our leader and his priests are here with trumpets, ready to blow them and call us to battle against you. People of Israel, don't fight against the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of your ancestors! You can't win!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meanwhile Jeroboam had sent some of his troops to ambush the Judean army from the rear, while the rest faced them from the front. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Judeans looked round and saw that they were surrounded. They cried to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " for help, and the priests blew the trumpets. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Judeans gave a loud shout, and led by Abijah, they attacked; God defeated Jeroboam and the Israelite army. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Israelites fled from the Judeans, and God let the Judeans overpower them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abijah and his army dealt the Israelites a crushing defeat — half a million of Israel's best soldiers were killed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And so the people of Judah were victorious over Israel, because they relied on the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of their ancestors.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abijah pursued Jeroboam's army and occupied some of his cities: Bethel, Jeshanah, and Ephron, and the villages near each of these cities. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeroboam never regained his power during Abijah's reign. Finally the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " struck him down, and he died.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abijah, however, grew more powerful. He had fourteen wives and fathered 22 sons and sixteen daughters. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The rest of the history of Abijah, what he said and what he did, is written in ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
